        <div class="hot" style="left:4.5%;top:82%;width:30%;height:5.5%"></div><div class="pin" style="left:37%;top:84.5%">2</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:30%;top:74%">3</div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="shot sm abs" style="left:1100px;top:330px;width:580px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px -10px rgba(18,19,23,.5)"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>… the end of the same article</span></div>
      <div class="scr"><img src="shots/p3-article-sources.jpg" alt="The sources and signature of the article">
        <div class="pin" style="left:93%;top:8%">4</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:93%;top:57%">5</div>
        <div class="hot g" style="left:3%;top:86%;width:84%;height:13%"></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · 31 signed articles, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 5 · companies and the graph -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Companies and the graph</b></span><span>05</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The summit as a knowledge graph</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:60px">120 companies, each a sourced profile, all one graph.</h2>
  <div class="stage" style="height:640px;margin-top:36px">
    <div class="shot abs" style="left:0;top:0;width:960px"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/companies/1password/</span></div>
      <div class="scr"><img src="shots/p3-company.jpg" alt="A company profile">
        <div class="hot" style="left:10%;top:40%;width:70%;height:35%"></div><div class="pin" style="left:82%;top:44%">1</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:41%;top:33%">2</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:8%;top:81%">3</div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="abs" style="left:1010px;top:0;width:670px">
      <div class="shot sm"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>an infographic card, drawn from the graph</span></div><img src="img/card-brazil.png" alt="Brazil's startup mission, a graph card"></div>
      <ol class="co" style="margin-top:34px">
        <li><b>Its neighbourhood, drawn</b>Fields, countries, related companies; open it in the explorer.</li>
        <li><b>Its flows, and where AI agents sit in them</b>The page a company lands on from our editors.</li>
        <li><b>What they do, with the source</b>Public facts only, each re-checked at the source.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · also 240 events, 264 people, 236 organisations, 83 places</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 6 · search and ask -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Search and Ask</b></span><span>06</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Ask the newsroom</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:60px">An assistant that answers from the site, with your key, in your browser.</h2>
  <div class="stage" style="height:620px;margin-top:36px">
    <div class="shot abs" style="left:0;top:0;width:900px"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/search/?q=security</span></div>
      <div class="scr"><img src="shots/p3-search.jpg" alt="Search">
        <div class="pin" style="left:93%;top:35%">1</div>
        <div class="hot g" style="left:9%;top:40.5%;width:12%;height:5%"></div><div class="pin g" style="left:24%;top:43%">2</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:93%;top:57%">3</div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="phone abs" style="left:950px;top:-10px;width:290px"><img src="shots/p3-m-ask.jpg" alt="Ask the newsroom on a phone"></div>
    <div class="abs" style="left:1290px;top:0;width:390px">
      <ol class="co">
        <li><b>Search every page</b>Built at each release, runs in the browser.</li>
        <li><b>Answer in words</b>With the reader's own model key, kept in their browser.</li>
        <li><b>Filter by kind, day, country</b>Companies, events, people, articles.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="note" style="margin-top:20px">Each answer shows the <b>tools it ran</b> on the site and the <b>sources</b> it read. No answer leaves without them.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · the key is sent only to the reader's model provider</span></div>
</section>

