<!-- 9 · micropayments -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Micropayments</b></span><span>09</span></div>
  <div class="kicker red">Not advertising. Not a subscription.</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:60px">Read first. Pay pennies for what you actually read.</h2>
  <div class="flow" style="margin-top:34px">
    <div class="step" style="padding:22px 24px"><div class="n" style="font-size:44px">1</div><h3>A starting credit</h3><p>No account, no card to begin.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="padding:22px 24px"><div class="n" style="font-size:44px">2</div><h3>The meter</h3><p>Pence per page, by the share you read.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="padding:22px 24px"><div class="n" style="font-size:44px">3</div><h3>Never blocked</h3><p>The balance can go below zero.</p></div>
    <div class="step" style="padding:22px 24px"><div class="n" style="font-size:44px">4</div><h3>Top up after</h3><p>By card, once you have had the value.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stage" style="height:430px;margin-top:34px">
    <div class="shot abs" style="left:0;top:0;width:1000px"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/account/</span></div>
      <div class="scr" style="height:388px;overflow:hidden"><img src="shots/account.jpg" alt="The reading account" style="margin-top:-150px">
        <div class="pin" style="left:24%;top:30%">1</div>
        <div class="pin" style="left:68%;top:20%">4</div>
        <div class="hot" style="left:57%;top:55%;width:12%;height:42%"></div><div class="pin" style="left:63%;top:51%">2</div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="abs" style="left:1050px;top:0;width:630px">
      <div class="note" style="font-size:24px"><b>Why it works:</b> people pay because they already got something, not for a promise. A rating re-prices a page; a reader can decline and say why.</div>
      <div class="note r" style="margin-top:24px;font-size:24px"><b>Everything stays in the browser:</b> the meter, the history, the receipts. Live on Dinis Cruz's newsroom.sgit.ai since 11 October 2026.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · "Paying after the value", newsroom.sgit.ai, 14 Oct 2026</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 10 · the vault -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The vault</b></span><span>10</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Your data is yours</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:60px">A passkey opens your vault. We only ever hold ciphertext.</h2>
  <div class="stage" style="height:640px;margin-top:36px">
    <div class="shot abs" style="left:0;top:0;width:1000px"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/account/vault.html</span></div>
      <div class="scr"><img src="shots/vault.jpg" alt="The vault">
        <div class="hot g" style="left:86%;top:30%;width:11%;height:7%"></div><div class="pin g" style="left:84%;top:33.5%">1</div>
        <div class="pin g" style="left:84%;top:47%">2</div>
        <div class="pin g" style="left:84%;top:69%">3</div>
        <div class="hot" style="left:54.5%;top:58%;width:25%;height:9%"></div><div class="pin" style="left:54%;top:62.5%">4</div>
      </div></div>
    <div class="abs" style="left:1050px;top:0;width:630px">
      <ol class="co g">
        <li><b>Sign in with a passkey</b>Your phone or laptop unlocks it. No password, no email.</li>
        <li><b>Create it once</b>Its keys are made in your browser.</li>
        <li><b>Every device, or a recovery code</b>Open it on the next device; records merge.</li>
      </ol>
      <ol class="co" start="4" style="counter-reset:co 3">
        <li><b>Encrypted before it leaves</b>The server keeps only what it cannot read.</li>
      </ol>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 630 120" width="630" height="120" style="margin-top:6px">
        <rect x="0" y="20" width="170" height="80" fill="#006600"/><text x="85" y="68" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="22" font-weight="600">your device</text>
        <line x1="175" y1="60" x2="445" y2="60" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="9 7"/>
        <text x="310" y="46" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#c52830">a9f3…e71c</text>
        <text x="310" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#595c64">only ciphertext</text>
        <rect x="455" y="20" width="175" height="80" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="2"/><text x="542" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" font-weight="600">vault server</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · the vault is a beta, built on sgit's encrypted vaults</span></div>
</section>

