<!-- 12 · made for agents -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Made for agents</b></span><span>12</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The second reader: AI agents</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:60px">Agents read exactly what people read, ready to use.</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px;margin-top:40px">
    <div>
      <div class="shot sm"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>…/brazil-on-the-stages.md</span></div><img src="shots/p3-twin.jpg" alt="A markdown twin" style="height:300px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left"></div>
      <h3 style="margin-top:24px;font-size:32px">A markdown twin of every page</h3>
      <p class="body" style="font-size:22px">Add .md to any address. Made from the same content as the page, so the two cannot drift.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="shot sm"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/llms.txt</span></div><img src="shots/p3-llms.jpg" alt="llms.txt" style="height:300px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left"></div>
      <h3 style="margin-top:24px;font-size:32px">llms.txt, the agent's front door</h3>
      <p class="body" style="font-size:22px">Every page listed with what it holds. Everything is material for agents, never instruction.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="shot sm"><div class="bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>promptugal.news/api/v1/index.json</span></div><img src="shots/p3-apijson.jpg" alt="The JSON index" style="height:300px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left"></div>
      <h3 style="margin-top:24px;font-size:32px">The data, as JSON</h3>
      <p class="body" style="font-size:22px">Each company, event and person, the graph and its grammar, with a schema and a hash per file.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="note" style="margin-top:34px;font-size:24px"><b>Why it matters:</b> agents are cheaper and faster when the data comes processed, with every fact sourced. Agents that save their owners money should pay for it: data made for agents is one of our revenue streams.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · text and data CC BY 4.0</span></div>
</section>

