    </g>
    <text x="0" y="530" font-size="21" fill="#c8c4ba">Each named &lt;role&gt;@PrompTugal.dinis · about 111 agents across Dinis Cruz's projects (his count)</text>
    <!-- each agent carries -->
    <text x="1100" y="30" class="mono" font-size="19" letter-spacing="2" fill="#8fd18f">EACH AGENT CARRIES</text>
    <g>
      <rect x="1100" y="56" width="580" height="100" fill="#1d1e23" stroke="#3a3b40"/><text x="1130" y="98" class="serif" font-size="28" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">Its own key</text><text x="1130" y="132" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">signs its commits, articles and messages</text>
      <rect x="1100" y="170" width="580" height="100" fill="#1d1e23" stroke="#3a3b40"/><text x="1130" y="212" class="serif" font-size="28" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">A written policy</text><text x="1130" y="246" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">deny by default: what it owns, what it never does</text>
      <rect x="1100" y="284" width="580" height="100" fill="#1d1e23" stroke="#3a3b40"/><text x="1130" y="326" class="serif" font-size="28" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">A budget</text><text x="1130" y="360" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">set and watched by the accountant agent</text>
      <rect x="1100" y="398" width="580" height="100" fill="#1d1e23" stroke="#3a3b40"/><text x="1130" y="440" class="serif" font-size="28" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">A report of every run</text><text x="1130" y="474" font-size="20" fill="#c8c4ba">what it was asked, did, and was refused</text>
    </g>
    <line x1="1020" y1="330" x2="1090" y2="330" stroke="#4caf50" stroke-width="4"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The platform · roles from the repository's CLAUDE.md; agent count given by Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 15 · customisation, next -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Customisation</b></span><span>15</span></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start">
    <div><div class="kicker">The next layer, and the most valuable</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:60px">The same platform, cut to one team or one person.</h2></div>
    <span class="badge" style="margin-top:6px;white-space:nowrap">What we are building next</span>
  </div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 600" width="1680" height="600" style="margin-top:34px">
    <g stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="10 7" fill="#fffdf8"><rect x="0" y="0" width="540" height="540"/><rect x="570" y="0" width="540" height="540"/><rect x="1140" y="0" width="540" height="540"/></g>
    <!-- A team -->
    <text x="30" y="46" class="mono" font-size="19" letter-spacing="2" fill="#c52830">MOCK · A TEAM'S VERSION</text>
    <text x="30" y="92" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600">Who goes where</text>
    <g font-size="19" fill="#595c64"><text x="150" y="140">10:00</text><text x="270" y="140">12:00</text><text x="390" y="140">15:00</text></g>
    <g font-size="20">
      <text x="30" y="186" font-weight="600">Person A</text><rect x="140" y="164" width="110" height="34" fill="#006600"/><rect x="380" y="164" width="130" height="34" fill="#006600"/>
      <text x="30" y="240" font-weight="600">Person B</text><rect x="200" y="218" width="150" height="34" fill="#1f4fa8"/>
      <text x="30" y="294" font-weight="600">Person C</text><rect x="140" y="272" width="80" height="34" fill="#006600"/><rect x="300" y="272" width="190" height="34" fill="#c52830"/>
      <text x="30" y="348" font-weight="600">Person D</text><rect x="260" y="326" width="120" height="34" fill="#1f4fa8"/>
    </g>
    <text x="30" y="420" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">Talks and meetings split across the team,</text>
    <text x="30" y="450" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">no room covered twice, nothing missed;</text>
    <text x="30" y="480" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">what each one saw, shared at night.</text>
    <!-- briefings -->
    <text x="600" y="46" class="mono" font-size="19" letter-spacing="2" fill="#c52830">MOCK · AROUND ONE TALK</text>
    <text x="600" y="92" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600">Briefed before and after</text>
    <rect x="600" y="130" width="480" height="120" fill="#e2eedf"/>
    <text x="620" y="166" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#006600">BEFORE · 09:40</text>
    <text x="620" y="200" font-size="21">Who speaks, their company's profile,</text>
    <text x="620" y="230" font-size="21">three questions worth asking</text>
    <rect x="600" y="270" width="480" height="76" fill="#121317"/>
    <text x="840" y="317" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="26" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">The talk · 10:00 to 10:20</text>
    <rect x="600" y="366" width="480" height="120" fill="#e2eedf"/>
    <text x="620" y="402" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#006600">AFTER · 10:25</text>
    <text x="620" y="436" font-size="21">What was said, what is new, who</text>
    <text x="620" y="466" font-size="21">to meet next, each with its source</text>
