    <g font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">
      <text x="0" y="66" class="mono" fill="#006600">NOV 2024</text><text x="0" y="160" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">MyFeeds.ai</text><text x="0" y="188">graphs of content and persons</text>
      <text x="560" y="66" class="mono" fill="#006600">2025</text><text x="560" y="160" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Trust and payment</text><text x="560" y="188">sgit: vaults, keys, signatures</text>
      <text x="1000" y="66" class="mono" fill="#006600">AUG 2026</text><text x="1000" y="160" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">newsroom.sgit.ai</text><text x="1000" y="188">pay per read</text>
      <text x="1260" y="66" class="mono" fill="#006600">OCT</text><text x="1260" y="160" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">A book</text><text x="1260" y="188">by agents</text>
    </g>
    <text x="1680" y="66" text-anchor="end" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#c52830">4 TO 7 NOV 2026</text>
    <text x="1680" y="160" text-anchor="end" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">PrompTugal.news</text>
    <text x="1680" y="188" text-anchor="end" font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">three days</text>
  </svg>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:30px">Every layer in this deck is reused: the graphs from MyFeeds.ai, the vaults and keys from sgit, the meter from newsroom.sgit.ai. <b>The agentic team is what made it fast.</b></p>
  <div class="src" style="margin-top:20px">Counted from the public repository, github.com/PrompTugal/PrompTugal__News__Website, 7 November 2026 (first commit 4 Nov 2026, 00:08 UTC); also 264 people, 236 organisations, 83 places. They grow every hour.</div>
